I'm on the home stretch (only 5 more to go...) I'll try and find a few live setups too.\n\nAUD/USD H4\n\nAUD/USD Daily","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#368","p":15,"im":["8b2a84fb8e17545fd76218884e330370b4066040","9d7d2d42d9adb5595c2bf8a0ef01a8b62494c614"],"m":368},{"id":"quasimodo_p15_369","t":"Found one!\n\nUnfortunatley as I was marking up the chart and taking screenshots etc price had already started dropping. But was very nice to see price start to drop from the predicted LH supply. Lets see if it goes the whole way, not much to stop it on the way down.\n\nCAD/CHF M5\n\nCAD/CHF H1","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#369","p":15,"im":["1ed329bdd5dc110271364a33819425e96d7d9d16"],"m":369},{"id":"quasimodo_p15_370","t":"Great job on finding these, all are very good setups you have posted.","a":"Infest","d":"","n":"#370","p":15,"im":[],"m":370},{"id":"quasimodo_p15_371","t":"Ok so an update for that live QM....\n\nUnfortunately it did not break the LL and continue down to the lower demand. Instead it hit the nearest demand (at the LL) and bounced back up to form a range.\n\nCan anyone spot a technical reason why this failed? I thought it was a winner for sure\n\nEDIT: How would have you personally managed the trade? But please no obvious 20-20 hindsight explanations - no one can see the future. This is what interests me most and I think could be the difference between success and failure in trading.\n\nMy guess would be a move to break-even once LL is reached, leading to eventual break-even trade? Or do you let most trades play out completely - either it hits the target or the stop.\n\nCAD/CHF M5","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#371","p":15,"im":["0baa4545e6912cef0b25be7b071cee03d981d5e1"],"m":371},{"id":"quasimodo_p15_372","t":"Found another live setup. Can't put my finger on it but I'm not sure about this one..... but who knows since I thought my last live QM was an A+ setup but turned out wrong...\n\nGBP/JPY M30","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#372","p":15,"im":["9d69c593eda2d5